s Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:4293","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4293"},{"target_title":"Santiago","label":"Santiago","target_id":"huntik:page:2055","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Santiago","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2055"}]},{"name":"first","value_wikitext":"\"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\" (flashback)","value_text":"\"A Seeker Is Born\" (flashback)","links":[{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"}]},{"name":"last","value_wikitext":"","value_text":"","links":[]}],"start":0,"end":454}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"When [[Lucas Casterwill|Lucas]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] were children, [[Kiel]] of the [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood]] set the house on fire and destroyed it. The siblings believe their parents to have perished in the blaze. While Sophie escaped thanks to [[Santiago]], Lucas made it out separately, leading them to believed Lucas was dead. {{source|Chasing Void}}\n\nThis tragedy is a traumatic memory for Sophie, thus she regularly has PTSD flashbacks of it. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\n{{Clear}}","text":"When Lucas and Sophie Casterwill were children, Kiel of the Blood Spiral Brotherhood set the house on fire and destroyed it. The siblings believe their parents to have perished in the blaze. While Sophie escaped thanks to Santiago, Lucas made it out separately, leading them to believed Lucas was dead. [Chasing Void]\n\nThis tragedy is a traumatic memory for Sophie, thus she regularly has PTSD flashbacks of it. [A Seeker Is Born]"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:S1E18 Paris Casterwill house Santiago Sophie 1.png|The fire inside the house\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house.png|The hill in present-days\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house 2.png|The ruins upclose\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Houses]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family bases]]\n[[Category:Paris, France]]","text":"File:S1E18 Paris Casterwill house Santiago Sophie 1.png|The fire inside the house\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house.png|The hill in present-days\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house 2.png|The ruins upclose"}],"full_text":"The Paris Casterwill house was the former house of Sophie Casterwill, Lucas Casterwill, and Santiago, perched atop a hill in Montmorency, Paris, France.\n\n== History ==\nWhen Lucas and Sophie Casterwill were children, Kiel of the Blood Spiral Brotherhood set the house on fire and destroyed it. The siblings believe their parents to have perished in the blaze. While Sophie escaped thanks to Santiago, Lucas made it out separately, leading them to believed Lucas was dead. [Chasing Void]\n\nThis tragedy is a traumatic memory for Sophie, thus she regularly has PTSD flashbacks of it. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\n==Gallery==\n\nFile:S1E18 Paris Casterwill house Santiago Sophie 1.png|The fire inside the house\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house.png|The hill in present-days\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house 2.png|The ruins upclose","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox location\n| image       = S1E18 Paris Casterwill house fire.png\n| aka         = \n| type        = House\n| location    = [[:Category:Paris, France|Paris, France]]\n| levels      = \n| areas       = \n| groups      = \n| titan       = \n| artifacts   = \n| guard titan = \n| traps       = \n| inhabitants = \n| former      = [[Sophie Casterwill]]<br>[[Lucas Casterwill]]<br>[[Santiago]]\n| first       = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\" (flashback)\n| last        = \n}}The '''Paris Casterwill house''' was the former house of [[Sophie Casterwill]], [[Lucas Casterwill]], and [[Santiago]], perched atop a hill in [[:Category:Paris, France|Montmorency, Paris, France]].\n\n== History ==\nWhen [[Lucas Casterwill|Lucas]] and [[Sophie Casterwill]] were children, [[Kiel]] of the [[Blood Spiral Brotherhood]] set the house on fire and destroyed it. The siblings believe their parents to have perished in the blaze. While Sophie escaped thanks to [[Santiago]], Lucas made it out separately, leading them to believed Lucas was dead. {{source|Chasing Void}}\n\nThis tragedy is a traumatic memory for Sophie, thus she regularly has PTSD flashbacks of it. {{source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\n{{Clear}}\n==Gallery==\n{{Gallery}}\n<gallery position=\"center\" captionalign=\"center\">\nFile:S1E18 Paris Casterwill house Santiago Sophie 1.png|The fire inside the house\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house.png|The hill in present-days\nS1E18 Paris Casterwill house 2.png|The ruins upclose\n</gallery>\n\n[[Category:Locations]]\n[[Category:Houses]]\n[[Category:Casterwill family bases]]\n[[Category:Paris, France]]","categories":["Casterwill family bases","Houses","Locations","Paris, France"],"links":[{"target_title":"Category:Paris, France","label":"Paris, France","target_id":"huntik:page:9034","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Paris%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Lucas Casterwill","label":"Lucas Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:4293","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4293"},{"target_title":"Santiago","label":"Santiago","target_id":"huntik:page:2055","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Santiago","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2055"},{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Lucas Casterwill","label":"Lucas Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:4293","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4293"},{"target_title":"Santiago","label":"Santiago","target_id":"huntik:page:2055","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Santiago","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2055"},{"target_title":"Category:Paris, France","label":"Montmorency, Paris, France","target_id":"huntik:page:9034","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Paris%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_title":"Lucas Casterwill","label":"Lucas","target_id":"huntik:page:4293","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lucas_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4293"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Kiel","label":"Kiel","target_id":"huntik:page:4554","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Kiel","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4554"},{"target_title":"Blood Spiral Brotherhood","label":"Blood Spiral Brotherhood","target_id":"huntik:page:3288","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Blood_Spiral_Brotherhood","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3288"},{"target_title":"Santiago","label":"Santiago","target_id":"huntik:page:2055","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Santiago","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2055"},{"target_title":"Category:Locations","label":"Category:Locations","tar